/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Since its inception in 2005 and subsequent establishment as a University in 2010 \(vide Odisha Act 4 of 2010\), Centurion has created a unique environment that ensures a tailored learning and employability path for youth in some of the poorest and underserved geographies in Odisha and Andhra Pradesh.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Centurion has embraced the Agenda for Sustainable Development and the associated Sustainable Development Goals \(SDGs\) since being formally announced in 2015. SDGs have been both formally and informally used as a guiding framework and are now firmly embedded in the Centurion DNA. Whilst having an indirect impact and contribution on almost all 17 SDGs, Centurion has specifically focused on 9 SDGs and embedded it in everything from its strategy, governance, institutional management and outcomes.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
